(text "Positive current -> OUTP - OUTN rises -> VMON rises -> PI gate rises -> Q1 sinks local ITH.\nHGND follows VOUT_COMMON near 100 V. PGND is floating secondary return. Never join HGND and PGND." (at 109.22 149.86 0) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left)) (uuid 7d93a93e-d245-4ee8-ad55-33c524522e26))
